#: main.cc:50
msgid ""
"\n"
"This program uses modified code and techniques from other KDE programs,\n"
"specifically kwrite, kiconedit and ksysv. Credit goes to authors\n"
"and maintainers.\n"
"\n"
"Leon Lessing, leon@lrlabs.com, has made parts of the bit swapping\n"
"functionality.\n"
"\n"
"Craig Graham, c_graham@hinge.mistral.co.uk, has made parts of\n"
"the bit stream functionality of the conversion field.\n"
"\n"
"Dima Rogozin, dima@mercury.co.il, has extended the string dialog\n"
"list capabilities.\n"
"\n"
"Edward Livingston-Blade, sbcs@bigfoot.com, has given me very good\n"
"reports which removed some nasty bugs.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"यो कार्यक्रमले अन्य केडीई कार्यक्रमबाट परिमार्जित सङ्केत र प्रविधिको प्रयोग गर्दछ,\n"
"विशेष गरेर kwrite, kiconedit र ksysv । लेखक र\n"
"मर्मतकर्तालाई श्रेय जान्छ ।\n"
"\n"
"Leon Lessing, leon@lrlabs.com, ले बिट स्विपिङ\n"
" प्रकार्यात्मकताको केही भाग बनाउनुभएको हो ।\n"
"\n"
"Craig Graham, c_graham@hinge.mistral.co.uk, ले रूपान्तरण फिल्डको बिट प्रवाह "
"प्रकार्यात्मकताको\n"
" केही भाग बनाउनुभएको हो ।\n"
"\n"
"Dima Rogozin, dima@mercury.co.il, ले स्ट्रिङ संवाद\n"
"सूचीको क्षमता विस्तार गर्नुभएको हो ।\n"
"\n"
"Edward Livingston-Blade, sbcs@bigfoot.com, ले धेरै राम्रो\n"
"प्रतिवेदन दिनुभएको हो जसले केही अश्लिल ब्लग हटायो ।\n"

